use you rolled your face into the water.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-24T18:03:31-07:00","id":1238432,"title":"","content":"I have this hilarious mental image of someone sleeping in a hotel bathtub, because the Pure version of a moot is taking place too far away from the beach.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Currently Playing:</b> <i>A large, mixed splat game of <b>CofD</b>.</i> <b>As:</b> Seraph du Salomon, Voice on the concordance. Unsubtle man reluctantly participating in the business of Magi. Awakening 2E homebrew <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1338514-house-du-salomon-a-proximus-dynasty?_=1569864567692\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...=1569864567692</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2598-gryphon-s-feather","name":"Gryphon's Feather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2598_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"215"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-24T18:05:48-07:00","id":1238433,"title":"","content":"Werewolves don't sleep much (they tend to take brief naps) and drowning in a bathtub seems like something they'd manage to